# Regenerated by `npm run build` (generate:group-previews / generate:seo-counts)
# every single build, straight from live 1C data — tracking them just means
# every deploy's fresh output collides with whatever snapshot happened to be
# committed last, blocking `git pull` on the server. Same treatment as
# public/styles/ above: generated at build time, never committed.
